Description: Querencia Desktop image viewer (alpha)
 Querencia Bilder is the image viewer of Querencia Desktop, a classic
 desktop in the style of GNOME 2. It shows PNG, JPEG, GIF, BMP, WebP and
 every other format gdk-pixbuf can load, with a classic menu bar, a
 compact toolbar, zoom, fit to window, full screen, slideshow, rotation
 and image properties.
 .
 Images are only displayed, never modified or saved. The desktop file
 names no image types; in the Querencia session querencia-session makes
 it the default viewer.
 .
 Querencia Desktop is developed with AI tools; every change is reviewed
 and accepted by the project owner.
 This is an alpha release.
